{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"main_base_l2","model_identifier":"main_base_l2","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# main_base_l2\n\nMain base level 2, Longhall: a longer log hall raised on a plank floor over short posts, steps up to a carved door frame, two smoke holes in a steep thatched roof. Clutter fills the rest of the footprint.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -112..112, y 0..151, z -112..112 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 157, construction_0 35, construction_33 53, construction_66 71, ruined 43 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hall: 108 x 150 x 196 (w x h x d) centred at x -4, z 2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `main_base_l2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `main_base_l2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_main_base_l2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-4, 0, -114)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-4, 152, -20)\n- `fx_smoke_2` at (-4, 152, 44)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (36, 0, -108)\n- `fx_flame` at (76, 12, -76)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"stilt00","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-51.0,0.0,-87.0],"to":[-45.0,10.0,-81.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[453.0,370.0,459.0,380.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[459.0,370.0,465.0,380.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[453.0,370.0,459.0,380.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[459.0,370.0,465.0,380.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[184.0,404.0,190.0,410.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[184.0,404.0,190.0,410.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c06f36e7-e264-5b91-a573-46bb3c8a1c86"},{"name":"stilt01","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-51.0,0.0,-43.0],"to":[-45.0,10.0,-37.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[453.0,370.0,459.0,380.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[465.0,370.0,471.0,380.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[453.0,370.0,459.0,380.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[465.0,370.0,471.0,380.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[190.0,404.0,196.0,410.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[190.0,404.0,196.0,410.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"27463388-3f10-5f03-aca5-7726f79836b4"},{"name":"stilt02","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-51.0,0.0,1.0],"to":[-45.0,10.0,7.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[453.0,370.0,459.0,380.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[471.0,370.0,477.0,380.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[453.0,370.0,459.0,380.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[471.0,370.0,477.0,380.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[196.0,404.0,202.0,410.0],"te