en":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"main_base_l2.png","name":"main_base_l2.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":512,"height":512,"uv_width":512,"uv_height":512,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"5931112a-2576-5e29-9fa2-e4e3d5ab5af7","relative_path":"main_base_l2.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"# main_base_l2\n\nMain base level 2, Longhall: a longer log hall raised on a plank floor over short posts, steps up to a carved door frame, two smoke holes in a steep thatched roof. Clutter fills the rest of the footprint.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -112..112, y 0..151, z -112..112 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 157, construction_0 35, construction_33 53, construction_66 71, ruined 43 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hall: 108 x 150 x 196 (w x h x d) centred at x -4, z 2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `main_base_l2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `main_base_l2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_main_base_l2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-4, 0, -114)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-4, 152, -20)\n- `fx_smoke_2` at (-4, 152, 44)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (36, 0, -108)\n- `fx_flame` at (76, 12, -76)\n"}